secubox-dpi (1.1.3-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=low

  * #718 Phase 3 — ASN enrichment: classify SNI-less flows (IP-only / QUIC,
    ~half of R3 traffic) by destination ASN via GeoLite2-ASN. When a flow has no
    SNI category and the dst ASN org is a known cloud/hosting provider
    (Amazon/Google/Cloudflare/OVH/…), tag category=cloud (service=ASN org) so the
    exfil_volume / new_cloud scenarios fire on it too. Closes the coverage gap
    for uncontrolled cloud egress without a hostname.
  * collector: vendor github.com/oschwald/maxminddb-golang (offline build,
    -mod=vendor + GOPROXY=off). Fail-soft when the mmdb is absent.

